[57.464066, "o", "\u001b[33m4b8bc9b\u001b[m\u001b[33m (\u001b[m\u001b[1;36mHEAD\u001b[m\u001b[33m -> \u001b[m\u001b[1;32mmain\u001b[m\u001b[33m, \u001b[m\u001b[1;31morigin/main\u001b[m\u001b[33m, \u001b[m\u001b[1;31morigin/HEAD\u001b[m\u001b[33m)\u001b[m Lab 3.9: explore.py shows one model call step by step (JSON r\u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;36m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;32m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;31m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;31m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[mequest, real reply, one token stream, stand-in reply); make promptfoo-check; scenario for the 'Understand the \u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;36m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;32m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;31m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[m\u001b[1;31m\u001b[m\u001b[33m\u001b[mlab' recording\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33me5989f7\u001b[m M0: labs/m00 with tiny_api.py (tech basics: HTTP, JSON, status codes, API keys on 127.0.0.1) and explo\u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[mre.py (lab 0.4 part 1: Ollama server, models, chat template, the exact chat request); scenarios for the tech b\u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[masics and both 'understand the lab' recordings\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mf64c1a4\u001b[m Lab 4.6: explore.py follows one message into every copy it leaves and takes Presidio apart (recognizer\u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[ms, spaCy NER, how each score is built); scenario for the 'Understand the lab"]
[57.464114, "o", "' recording\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m8a1e557\u001b[m Lab 6.7: explore.py and README Step 1b look at each RAG step (chunks, embeddings, search, prompt, answ\u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[mer) before the attacks; scenario for the 'Understand the lab' recording\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m502d5a9\u001b[m Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/rec-m7' into HEAD\u001b[m\r\n"]
